summary:
  The popup's seat pulls the face back while the window is meant to hold it.

history:
  There is one face and two seats, and each takes it only on its turn. A
  popup seat that takes it whenever it can leaves the window up and empty,
  and the popup showing a face and a placeholder at once.

target:
  package/contents/ui/PopupFace.qml

find:
          if (!face || away) return;

replace:
          if (!face) return;

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_playerwindow.qml::test_sent_to_the_window_the_same_face_sits_there_and_the_window_is_up.
